# Optional per-paper PDFs live here as <paper-id>.pdf.
#
# A paper references its PDF with a path relative to papers/ — that is,
# "pdf": "pdfs/<paper-id>.pdf" — because js/paper.js resolves `papers/${paper.pdf}`.
# CI enforces both halves: the prefix, and that the file actually exists.
#
# Signed-in submissions upload the PDF automatically (POST /papers commits it
# before the JSON that references it, so a paper can never point at a missing
# file). This directory is tracked so the documented location exists even when
# no PDFs have been added yet.
